### 🔹 STEP 3: Parse ZOOM voice command

(Add inside `HandleCommand()` **at the END**)

```csharp
// ================= ZOOM =================
if (text.Contains("zoom"))
{
    float duration = ExtractDuration(text);

    if (text.Contains("in"))
    {
        targetZoomVelocity = cam.transform.forward * zoomSpeed;
        zoomTimer = duration;
    }
    else if (text.Contains("out"))
    {
        targetZoomVelocity = -cam.transform.forward * zoomSpeed;
        zoomTimer = duration;
    }
}
