### 🔹 STEP 4: Add ZOOM UPDATE METHOD

(Paste anywhere in the class)

```csharp
void HandleZoom()
{
    if (zoomTimer <= 0f)
    {
        targetZoomVelocity = Vector3.zero;
        return;
    }

    zoomTimer -= Time.deltaTime;

    currentZoomVelocity = Vector3.Lerp(
        currentZoomVelocity,
        targetZoomVelocity,
        zoomSmooth * Time.deltaTime
    );

    Vector3 nextPos =
        cam.transform.position + currentZoomVelocity * Time.deltaTime;

    float distanceToTarget =
        Vector3.Distance(nextPos, target.position);

    // 🚧 LIMIT CHECK (TARGET RELATIVE)
    if (distanceToTarget < minZoomDistance ||
        distanceToTarget > maxZoomDistance)
        return;

    cam.transform.position = nextPos;
}
```

🧠 This is the **core zoom logic**:

* smooth velocity
* calculate next camera position
* check distance to target
* move camera ONLY if inside limits

